eld'><Name>match_strings</Name><Type>esriFieldTypeString</Type><IsNullable>true</IsNullable><Length>11</Length><Precision>0</Precision><Scale>0</Scale><AliasName>Match</AliasName><DefaultValue xsi:type='xs:string'>yes</DefaultValue><Domain xsi:type='typens:CodedValueDomain'><DomainName>match_string</DomainName><FieldType>esriFieldTypeString</FieldType><MergePolicy>esriMPTDefaultValue</MergePolicy><SplitPolicy>esriSPTDefaultValue</SplitPolicy><Description>Indicates how two strings should be matched or blocked.</Description><Owner></Owner><CodedValues xsi:type='typens:ArrayOfCodedValue'><CodedValue xsi:type='typens:CodedValue'><Name>Predictive Block</Name><Code xsi:type='xs:string'>no</Code></CodedValue><CodedValue xsi:type='typens:CodedValue'><Name>Predictive Match</Name><Code xsi:type='xs:string'>yes</Code></CodedValue><CodedValue xsi:type='typens:CodedValue'><Name>Exact Block</Name><Code xsi:type='xs:string'>exact_block</Code></CodedValue><CodedValue xsi:type='typens:CodedValue'><Name>Exact Match</Name><Code xsi:type='xs:string'>exact_match</Code></CodedValue></CodedValues></Domain></Field></FieldArray></Fields><Records xsi:type='typens:ArrayOfRecord'></Records></RecordSet><OIDFieldName>OBJECTID</OIDFieldName></GPRecordSet>",
